&lt;tr style="height:22.5pt;min-height:22.5pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;総株主の議決権&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;―&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:right;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;20,681&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;―&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:3pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;"&gt;(注) １．当社は2024年２月８日付で普通株式１株につき普通株式100株の株式分割を行っております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:27pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;"&gt;２．当社は2024年２月８日より単元株制度を採用しております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:IssuedSharesVotingRightsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_SharesWithNoVotingRightsMember" xsi:nil="true"/>
  <jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_SharesWithRestrictedVotingRightsTreasurySharesEtcMember" xsi:nil="true"/>
  <jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_SharesWithRestrictedVotingRightsOtherMember" xsi:nil="true"/>
  <jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_OrdinarySharesTreasurySharesSharesWithFullVotingRightsTreasurySharesEtcMember" xsi:nil="true"/>
  <jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_OrdinarySharesSharesWithFullVotingRightsOtherMember">完全議決権株式であり、権利内容に何ら限定のない当社における標準となる株式であります。また、１単元の株式数は100株であります。</jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights>
  <jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_OrdinarySharesSharesLessThanOneUnitMember" xsi:nil="true"/>
  <jpcrp_cor:TreasurySharesEtcTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h5 class="smt_head4"&gt;② 【自己株式等】&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text4" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:TreasurySharesEtcTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:ClassesOfSharesEtcTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">&lt;p class="smt_head6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:3pt;font-size:3pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:25pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:389.5pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
